WEBVTT

00:01.410 --> 00:02.580
<b>There's no doubt.</b>

00:02.660 --> 00:06.080
<b>Eiji is the one who killed our mother.</b>

00:06.790 --> 00:09.250
<b>It's a... ghost.</b>

00:09.880 --> 00:12.170
<b>But how can that be?</b>

00:12.470 --> 00:14.930
<b>Why would he do that to our mother?</b>

00:15.260 --> 00:17.470
<b>That's what we need to find out.</b>

00:18.100 --> 00:21.310
<b>So we'll have to put the screws on Eiji.</b>

00:22.230 --> 00:23.850
<b>No, I have an idea.</b>

00:25.310 --> 00:26.060
<b>What is it?</b>

00:27.190 --> 00:30.190
<b>Leave it to me to interrogate Eiji.</b>

00:30.400 --> 00:33.490
<b>You focus on studying, okay?</b>

00:40.240 --> 00:41.700
<b>I'm going.</b>

00:41.790 --> 00:43.910
<b>-Off you go!
-Bye bye, Hitori.</b>

00:44.000 --> 00:45.870
<b>Do good again today!</b>

00:47.040 --> 00:48.920
<b><i>Wait, Migi.</i></b>

00:49.800 --> 00:51.380
<b><i>I promise to</i></b>

00:51.460 --> 00:54.170
<b><i>bring back the truth about</i>
<i>our mother's death.</i></b>

00:56.390 --> 00:58.510
<b><i>If I approach as a girl,</i></b>

00:58.550 --> 01:01.600
<b><i>even someone like Eiji</i>
<i>will let his guard down.</i></b>

02:37.610 --> 02:41.410
<b>Hey, Eiji, what's your type?</b>

02:45.620 --> 02:48.910
<b>I can't really
categorize women that easily.</b>

02:49.960 --> 02:51.710
<b>Come on now, Eiji.</b>

02:51.790 --> 02:54.880
<b>There must be something.
Big breasts, maybe?</b>

02:54.960 --> 02:58.380
<b>A girl who shows
the nape of her neck, or blondes?</b>

03:00.430 --> 03:01.680
<b>I'm bored with this.</b>

03:01.760 --> 03:03.510
<b>I am too occupied with my studies</b>

03:03.550 --> 03:06.010
<b>to view women in such a way.</b>

03:06.100 --> 03:07.850
<b>Th- That's true!</b>

03:07.930 --> 03:09.850
<b>Guys! Watch your mouth!</b>

03:10.810 --> 03:15.150
<b>Well, I'll go check the materials
I'll be giving out in homeroom.</b>

03:15.570 --> 03:17.650
<b>Eiji is really...</b>

03:17.730 --> 03:19.280
<b>He's perfect.</b>

03:21.030 --> 03:22.870
<b><i>Damn it! Again!</i></b>

03:23.620 --> 03:25.490
<b><i>Who is she?</i></b>

03:26.200 --> 03:29.710
<b><i>Now... Stop thinking about it.</i>
<i>Stay perfect as usual.</i></b>

03:29.790 --> 03:32.580
<b><i>Don't let anyone notice anything.</i></b>

03:32.880 --> 03:37.130
<b>Oh no, today's lunch turned into stew.</b>

03:39.340 --> 03:41.050
<b>Stinky stew.</b>

03:46.050 --> 03:47.010
<b>Who are you?</b>

03:47.100 --> 03:48.270
<b>Guess who?</b>

03:48.350 --> 03:50.930
<b>If you tell anyone about what you just saw</b>

03:51.020 --> 03:53.900
<b>you won't ever
be able to walk the hallways</b>

03:53.980 --> 03:56.150
<b>without being called a criminal.</b>

03:56.820 --> 03:58.900
<b>I don't mind. I'll just run.</b>

04:02.530 --> 04:04.490
<b><i>What's with that girl!</i></b>

04:15.880 --> 04:17.340
<b>Wait!</b>

04:19.920 --> 04:21.010
<b>Ah!</b>

04:24.260 --> 04:25.930
<b>What do you want?</b>

04:27.510 --> 04:28.640
<b>Money?</b>

04:29.350 --> 04:31.560
<b>Huh, is that hush money?</b>

04:36.900 --> 04:39.730
<b>Listen, I want to see even more</b>

04:40.230 --> 04:43.030
<b>of your embarrassing sides.</b>

04:43.570 --> 04:45.410
<b>That's the only currency I'll take.</b>

04:46.070 --> 04:48.410
<b>What do you mean...</b>

04:54.620 --> 04:58.000
<b>Oh, that's embarrassing.
This is you as a five-year-old?</b>

04:58.090 --> 05:02.210
<b>How is that embarrassing?
It is a road that everybody takes.</b>

05:02.300 --> 05:03.630
<b>Ah, did you know?</b>

05:03.720 --> 05:07.470
<b>A five-year-old kid's intelligence is
equivalent to that of a dog.</b>

05:07.550 --> 05:10.850
<b>Which means this Eiji is
the same as an animal.</b>

05:10.970 --> 05:13.600
<b>I'm not an animal. Anyway...</b>

05:13.680 --> 05:16.770
<b>-What you saw yesterday is…
-Oh, this is not enough.</b>

05:16.850 --> 05:18.810
<b>Show me more of your animal pictures.</b>

05:38.960 --> 05:41.090
<b>That was my favorite pajama.</b>

05:42.050 --> 05:43.760
<b>It's a pretty pajama.</b>

05:43.840 --> 05:47.630
<b>Why is one button missing on the 25th?</b>

05:48.470 --> 05:50.890
<b>I don't remember that day very well.</b>

05:51.680 --> 05:52.560
<b>I see...</b>

05:52.850 --> 05:56.980
<b>But considering I still
believed in Santa back then,</b>

05:57.060 --> 05:59.190
<b>I'll admit I was practically an animal.</b>

05:59.900 --> 06:02.230
<b>How old were you
when you stopped believing?</b>

06:06.740 --> 06:09.240
<b>Santa Claus never came to me.</b>

06:12.660 --> 06:14.750
<b>Show me pictures from when you were five.</b>

06:14.830 --> 06:15.660
<b>I have none.</b>

06:16.330 --> 06:19.420
<b>Hey... Don't misunderstand.</b>

06:20.380 --> 06:22.420
<b>This is just hush money.</b>

06:23.710 --> 06:26.590
<b>Yeah, I know.</b>

06:26.670 --> 06:28.130
<b>I've seen enough pictures.</b>

06:28.220 --> 06:31.430
<b>I want you to
tell me more about your past next.</b>

06:32.350 --> 06:35.470
<b><i>But... How is that fair?</i></b>

06:35.520 --> 06:38.190
<b><i>I'm giving you so much information,</i></b>

06:38.690 --> 06:40.650
<b><i>but you won't even say your name.</i></b>

06:41.520 --> 06:43.610
<b><i>It's not fair...</i></b>

06:45.690 --> 06:47.860
<b><i>What even is 〝fair.〞</i></b>

06:52.410 --> 06:55.830
<b>Huh? A girl with sharp eyes and long hair?</b>

06:56.330 --> 06:58.330
<b>-That's me!
-You're not, it's me!</b>

06:58.410 --> 07:00.460
<b>-Me!
-It's me!</b>

07:01.330 --> 07:04.170
<b><i>I've sought</i>
<i>all over the school, but no luck.</i></b>

07:04.960 --> 07:07.550
<b><i>Is she not a student here?</i></b>

07:10.970 --> 07:14.930
<b>Hitori. Your next class is
in the science room, right?</b>

07:15.010 --> 07:16.810
<b>You should head there now.</b>

07:17.600 --> 07:20.270
<b>Yes, Ms. Kodama.
We are going now.</b>

07:25.320 --> 07:26.940
<b><i>Tsk... Dali...</i></b>

07:27.440 --> 07:30.400
<b><i>〝Leave it to me to interrogate Eiji〞?</i></b>

07:30.900 --> 07:33.780
<b><i>He always takes the good bits.</i></b>

07:33.870 --> 07:34.660
<b>Huh?</b>

07:35.450 --> 07:36.330
<b>Hitori?</b>

07:38.000 --> 07:39.160
<b>Is that a bug?</b>

07:41.580 --> 07:42.710
<b><i>She's back!</i></b>

07:43.170 --> 07:45.920
<b>She is back! Sali's back!</b>

07:46.000 --> 07:48.630
<b>Hold on, Migi.
What are you talking about?</b>

07:49.760 --> 07:50.720
<b>Look!</b>

07:51.930 --> 07:54.390
<b>I found this on the stairs at school.</b>

07:54.760 --> 07:56.600
<b>One of them belongs to Sali.</b>

07:56.930 --> 08:00.020
<b>For us to be together
no matter where we are.</b>

08:00.810 --> 08:03.600
<b><i>Did I drop it? What a mistake...</i></b>

08:04.440 --> 08:07.480
<b>Listen well, Migi.
Sali is not here.</b>

08:07.570 --> 08:10.030
<b>Because she moved to a distant town.</b>

08:10.110 --> 08:10.940
<b>But...</b>

08:11.030 --> 08:13.450
<b>Do you understand, Migi?</b>

08:18.290 --> 08:21.830
<b>Dali says she is not here.
But I know she has to be</b>

08:21.910 --> 08:24.460
<b>somewhere in this school...</b>

08:25.040 --> 08:27.210
<b>What is this, Hitori?</b>

08:28.340 --> 08:30.010
<b>Missing?</b>

08:30.590 --> 08:32.800
<b>It's my goddess. Sali.</b>

08:33.380 --> 08:34.470
<b>Who's Sali?</b>

08:34.550 --> 08:36.800
<b>Go away! Don't follow me.</b>

08:41.230 --> 08:44.980
<b><i>This is Sali?</i>
<i>His drawing skills are awful.</i></b>

08:45.810 --> 08:49.780
<b>At this rate, he probably won't catch me.</b>

08:49.860 --> 08:51.280
<b>HITORI SONOYAMA</b>

08:53.650 --> 08:55.780
<b><i>Why is no one reporting any seeings?</i></b>

08:56.280 --> 08:57.910
<b>Hey, Akiyama. What are you doing?</b>

08:58.490 --> 09:02.370
<b>I'm analyzing the patterns
in your notebook doodles.</b>

09:02.910 --> 09:04.120
<b>You're doing it again.</b>

09:04.540 --> 09:06.670
<b>I enjoy creating montages of birds</b>

09:06.750 --> 09:09.130
<b>using parts of their fossils.</b>

09:09.840 --> 09:13.340
<b>Your art is too exquisite to
be understood by common folk.</b>

09:13.420 --> 09:15.380
<b>But by looking at these doodles,</b>

09:15.470 --> 09:18.350
<b>I can tell there's a pattern to them.</b>

09:18.890 --> 09:21.680
<b>This one is me, and this one is Eiji...</b>

09:22.470 --> 09:24.310
<b>They're pretty different.</b>

09:25.810 --> 09:29.480
<b>And this is
our homeroom teacher, Ms. Kodama.</b>

09:29.730 --> 09:32.150
<b>The way you
drew her hair resembles Sali's.</b>

09:32.690 --> 09:34.820
<b>Our teacher has straight black hair,</b>

09:35.320 --> 09:37.280
<b>so Sali must have the same.</b>

09:38.160 --> 09:41.330
<b>The shape of her eyes is similar to yours.</b>

09:41.990 --> 09:44.040
<b>If I strip away the characteristics,</b>

09:44.120 --> 09:46.500
<b>and reconstruct them...</b>

09:49.540 --> 09:52.420
<b>MISSING PERSON</b>

09:57.840 --> 09:59.890
<b>Not bad.</b>

09:59.970 --> 10:02.680
<b>Eh? This cute girl is missing?</b>

10:02.760 --> 10:05.640
<b>Long black hair, cat-like eyes...</b>

10:05.730 --> 10:07.100
<b>Huh? These features...</b>

10:08.060 --> 10:10.480
<b>Isn't this the girl Eiji was looking for?</b>

10:20.280 --> 10:22.580
<b>-Don't follow me!
-Ah, sorry.</b>

10:23.410 --> 10:27.250
<b>Don't get me wrong.
It's not that you're in the way.</b>

10:29.540 --> 10:31.460
<b>It's just too dangerous.</b>

10:32.290 --> 10:34.340
<b>You're my important helper, after all.</b>

10:38.720 --> 10:40.550
<b>Sorry I'm late.</b>

10:41.140 --> 10:43.810
<b>Huh? Oh, it's fine.</b>

10:45.430 --> 10:49.310
<b>Now, tell me about Christmas
back when you were five years old.</b>

10:49.560 --> 10:52.360
<b>Huh? Ah. Right.</b>

10:52.440 --> 10:54.110
<b>Christmas when I was five...</b>

10:54.610 --> 10:57.690
<b>On that day, I was eyeing
the turkey on the dining table...</b>

10:57.780 --> 11:00.200
<b><i>This is dreadful.</i></b>

11:00.610 --> 11:01.870
<b><i>I am currently</i></b>

11:01.950 --> 11:05.120
<b><i> harboring unnecessary</i>
<i>feelings for this girl.</i></b>

11:06.540 --> 11:07.500
<b>Sali!</b>

11:07.830 --> 11:11.120
<b>Mi... Hitori! How...?</b>

11:11.580 --> 11:13.960
<b>Let's go, it's dangerous here.</b>

11:14.040 --> 11:16.710
<b>Wait, we're talking.</b>

11:18.170 --> 11:20.260
<b>Don't put those dirty hands on Sali.</b>

11:20.340 --> 11:23.760
<b>You're the one
looking like an infectious rat.</b>

11:24.100 --> 11:26.560
<b>Sali, this guy is dangerous.</b>

11:26.640 --> 11:28.600
<b>Let's go back where we belong.</b>

11:29.640 --> 11:32.400
<b>Have you... and Hitori?</b>

11:38.240 --> 11:41.070
<b>I am dating Eiji.</b>

11:43.870 --> 11:44.580
<b>Huh?</b>

12:02.680 --> 12:03.760
<b>Come on in.</b>

12:04.180 --> 12:05.510
<b>Excuse me.</b>

12:06.050 --> 12:08.600
<b>Wow, what a lovely house.</b>

12:08.970 --> 12:10.480
<b>Where are your parents?</b>

12:10.890 --> 12:13.310
<b>Unfortunately, they are out today.</b>

12:13.810 --> 12:15.610
<b>Oh, so they're not here.</b>

12:16.980 --> 12:18.820
<b><i>Migi. Wait a little.</i></b>

12:19.610 --> 12:22.280
<b><i>I'll get Eiji's past out of him today.</i></b>

12:22.700 --> 12:26.740
<b><i>I'll put him under regressive hypnosis.</i></b>

12:27.120 --> 12:30.370
<b><i>I've practiced it over and over again...</i></b>

12:31.080 --> 12:33.830
<b>Your arms and legs gradually feel heavier.</b>

12:33.920 --> 12:36.590
<b>And your stomach
feels heavier and heavier...</b>

12:38.210 --> 12:42.170
<b>Sali... I am Anoyama Hitori.</b>

12:46.550 --> 12:48.100
<b><i>The stage is set.</i></b>

12:48.720 --> 12:51.640
<b><i>First, to make it</i>
<i>easier to hypnotize him,</i></b>

12:51.730 --> 12:53.560
<b><i>I have to make him lay down.</i></b>

12:54.190 --> 12:57.560
<b>Ugh, my Sali...</b>

12:57.860 --> 12:59.530
<b>It's going to be okay.</b>

12:59.610 --> 13:02.400
<b>There are as many girls
as there are stars in the sky.</b>

13:02.490 --> 13:04.610
<b>There's only one Sali!</b>

13:04.700 --> 13:07.490
<b>Right now, Sali's...</b>

13:08.280 --> 13:09.370
<b>Eiji.</b>

13:09.450 --> 13:12.660
<b>Can I come to your house next Sunday?</b>

13:15.080 --> 13:17.750
<b>Hitori, in times like these...</b>

13:18.540 --> 13:22.050
<b>you just gotta drink and forget!</b>

13:22.130 --> 13:23.510
<b>As if I could forget her!</b>

13:24.880 --> 13:26.970
<b>For Hitori's broken heart,</b>

13:27.050 --> 13:28.680
<b><i>Cheers!</i></b>

13:28.760 --> 13:30.930
<b><i>Sali!</i></b>

13:35.640 --> 13:38.400
<b>Eiji, I'm getting sleepy.</b>

13:38.440 --> 13:41.480
<b>We've only been
studying for fifteen minutes.</b>

13:41.570 --> 13:45.820
<b>I only invited you over because
you said you wanted me to tutor you.</b>

13:46.660 --> 13:48.780
<b>How about we take a nap?</b>

13:49.450 --> 13:50.950
<b>A siesta?</b>

13:51.240 --> 13:54.290
<b>Well, a 10-minute nap
might increase our efficiency.</b>

13:55.250 --> 13:56.870
<b>I'll show you to the guest room.</b>

13:58.500 --> 14:02.090
<b>Let's take a nap here, together.</b>

14:05.550 --> 14:07.340
<b>Are you a samurai, Eiji?</b>

14:07.970 --> 14:09.970
<b>I do not need a nap.</b>

14:10.470 --> 14:12.430
<b>I'll keep track of time instead.</b>

14:12.510 --> 14:14.310
<b><i>Pfh, he's a guardian of time?</i></b>

14:16.940 --> 14:20.150
<b>Hey, uhm, I...</b>

14:20.230 --> 14:24.480
<b>I can't sleep unless
someone is sleeping next to me.</b>

14:24.570 --> 14:25.530
<b>Huh?</b>

14:26.240 --> 14:28.280
<b>I can't sleep.</b>

14:31.700 --> 14:32.740
<b><i>As if I can sleep!</i></b>

14:33.330 --> 14:36.460
<b><i>Is this the bed of a cult?</i></b>

14:36.960 --> 14:38.620
<b>Can you fit in one more?</b>

14:38.710 --> 14:40.290
<b><i>Don't add that one.</i></b>

14:40.880 --> 14:43.880
<b><i>I didn't want to have to resort to this...</i></b>

14:44.710 --> 14:46.590
<b>Eiji...</b>

14:49.430 --> 14:50.390
<b>Wha...?!</b>

14:50.680 --> 14:52.510
<b>Somehow, I'm...</b>

14:54.930 --> 14:56.850
<b>I'm feeling hot...</b>

14:57.180 --> 14:59.600
<b>That's impure!</b>

14:59.900 --> 15:02.810
<b>Indecent! Primal! Vulgar!</b>

15:03.520 --> 15:07.030
<b>And... I'm disappointed!</b>

15:07.900 --> 15:09.200
<b>We still haven't even</b>

15:09.280 --> 15:12.370
<b>entered into a contract as lovers.</b>

15:12.740 --> 15:15.540
<b>Contract? You mean, paperwork?</b>

15:15.620 --> 15:17.580
<b>No, it's not like that...</b>

15:20.120 --> 15:22.080
<b>A buss, I suppose.</b>

15:23.000 --> 15:26.960
<b>A buss? If we do that,
will you lie next to me?</b>

15:27.050 --> 15:29.800
<b>I mean, it would make more sense then.</b>

15:30.180 --> 15:32.760
<b>Then, let's buss.</b>

15:33.470 --> 15:35.470
<b>C-can we?</b>

15:35.850 --> 15:36.600
<b>Yes.</b>

15:37.020 --> 15:40.230
<b><i>Buss or plus or cuss,</i>
<i>I have no clue what it means.</i></b>

15:40.310 --> 15:42.230
<b><i>It's probably nothing speci--</i></b>

15:42.310 --> 15:43.230
<b>Huh?</b>

15:44.440 --> 15:47.230
<b>Does he mean...
pressing our lips together?!</b>

15:47.650 --> 15:50.820
<b><i>No way, never, no. It's Eiji.</i></b>

15:52.160 --> 15:53.490
<b><i>No, this is wrong.</i></b>

15:53.820 --> 15:55.950
<b><i>Don't run away.</i></b>

15:56.740 --> 15:58.700
<b><i>It's all to reach the goal...</i></b>

15:59.710 --> 16:01.370
<b><i>But I really can't do this.</i></b>

16:02.710 --> 16:05.880
<b><i>I am dating Eiji.</i></b>

16:07.050 --> 16:08.880
<b><i>Migi...</i></b>

16:22.980 --> 16:24.610
<b><i>Migi, wait a little.</i></b>

16:24.690 --> 16:27.020
<b><i>I'll make sure to bring back the truth.</i></b>

16:34.990 --> 16:38.540
<b>Hitori, keep this between us,</b>

16:38.620 --> 16:41.660
<b>but your mom
turned me down countless times.</b>

16:42.250 --> 16:44.710
<b>Mom was very popular, you know.</b>

16:44.790 --> 16:45.630
<b>But,</b>

16:46.000 --> 16:49.340
<b>I kept trying, and now we're together.</b>

16:51.050 --> 16:54.680
<b>Though I suspect
she forgot all about that.</b>

16:56.090 --> 17:00.270
<b>Your arms and legs</b>

17:00.350 --> 17:03.230
<b>get heavier and heavier.</b>

17:03.560 --> 17:05.560
<b>What's that song?</b>

17:06.190 --> 17:08.150
<b>It's a lullaby from a distant country.</b>

17:08.860 --> 17:12.440
<b>Gradually, your stomach also</b>

17:12.530 --> 17:15.410
<b>gets heavier...</b>

17:16.570 --> 17:20.490
<b>Right, that was a fun Christmas dinner,
wasn't it?</b>

17:21.370 --> 17:22.410
<b>And then?</b>

17:23.040 --> 17:26.830
<b>I brushed my teeth... one by one...</b>

17:26.920 --> 17:29.710
<b>Remembering the molars...</b>

17:29.800 --> 17:32.170
<b><i>Almost there... almost.</i></b>

17:33.130 --> 17:35.300
<b><i>Eiji killed our mother </i></b>

17:35.380 --> 17:37.930
<b><i>some time between</i>
<i>Christmas Eve and Christmas...</i></b>

17:39.930 --> 17:40.890
<b>Eiji?</b>

17:41.310 --> 17:42.520
<b>II'll go to sleep now.</b>

17:43.350 --> 17:45.480
<b>If you're not a good boy...</b>

17:45.560 --> 17:47.770
<b>Santa Claus won't...</b>

17:50.150 --> 17:51.610
<b><i>He actually fell asleep?</i></b>

17:52.190 --> 17:55.110
<b><i>That's odd. If he slept</i>
<i>at this point, then nothing...</i></b>

17:57.700 --> 17:59.950
<b><i>Migi? Why is he here?</i></b>

18:07.210 --> 18:09.210
<b>-Sali.
-Hitori.</b>

18:09.590 --> 18:12.670
<b>I'm busy right now.
Can you please leave?</b>

18:13.210 --> 18:15.380
<b>Um, I...</b>

18:16.680 --> 18:18.550
<b>I love you, Sali.</b>

18:19.050 --> 18:20.890
<b>I couldn't give up on you.</b>

18:22.220 --> 18:24.520
<b>Will you please take me back?</b>

18:26.560 --> 18:29.100
<b>Hitori, how many times do I have to--</b>

18:30.730 --> 18:31.900
<b><i>He woke up?!</i></b>

18:35.190 --> 18:36.400
<b>Eiji?</b>

18:36.490 --> 18:40.120
<b>Go away. You're not part of--</b>

18:46.080 --> 18:47.790
<b>Sali!</b>

18:47.870 --> 18:50.670
<b>The pendant! The dolphin pendant!</b>

18:50.750 --> 18:51.840
<b><i>Idiot!</i></b>

18:55.130 --> 18:58.720
<b>That's not what's important right now!</b>

19:06.480 --> 19:09.020
<b>-What's his problem?
-It wasn't...</b>

19:09.310 --> 19:11.690
<b>-Are you trying to kill him?
-It wasn't...</b>

19:11.770 --> 19:15.320
<b>It wasn't... like that...</b>

19:16.070 --> 19:17.030
<b>Huh?</b>

19:17.490 --> 19:19.320
<b>It wasn't a ghost...</b>

19:20.450 --> 19:21.660
<b>What do you mean?</b>

19:21.740 --> 19:24.990
<b>This sensation, there's no mistaking it.</b>

19:25.990 --> 19:28.830
<b>How could I have believed it all along?</b>

19:29.290 --> 19:31.710
<b>Calm down. What happened?</b>

19:32.500 --> 19:35.500
<b>It happened at night,
that Christmas when I was five.</b>

19:43.010 --> 19:44.510
<b>Santa Claus?</b>

20:23.800 --> 20:26.510
<b>Mom! Quickly, over here!</b>

20:29.430 --> 20:31.560
<b>-She's not there.
-She was there!</b>

20:32.190 --> 20:34.690
<b>Eiji, in all of Origon Village</b>

20:34.770 --> 20:38.400
<b>there are no women with long blonde hair.</b>

20:38.480 --> 20:40.940
<b>You saw a ghost.</b>

20:41.570 --> 20:44.070
<b>Got it? It was a ghost.</b>

20:44.160 --> 20:45.410
<b>A ghost...</b>

20:46.200 --> 20:49.290
<b>I'm scared. Will you sleep with me?</b>

20:49.370 --> 20:50.660
<b>Yes.</b>

21:13.390 --> 21:16.770
<b><i>Migi. Migi! I figured it out.</i></b>

21:17.900 --> 21:20.030
<b><i>This is how Eiji took...</i></b>

21:21.360 --> 21:23.320
<b><i>our mother away from us.</i></b>

21:24.450 --> 21:26.870
<b><i>I have gathered the evidence, now's the time.</i></b>

21:29.030 --> 21:32.910
<b>Migi, it's time to get revenge.</b>

23:03.550 --> 23:06.510
<b>Migi, it's time to get revenge.</b>

23:09.760 --> 23:10.680
<b>Migi?</b>

23:12.050 --> 23:15.220
<b>I finished interrogating him,
Eiji did it--</b>

23:24.190 --> 23:27.610
<b>I will never forgive you.</b>
